    {
      "id": "cs_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 349.80120230258103,
      "y": 992.1867746716096,
      "width": 266,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "• kSnapshotChunkSize=512KiB 切片\n• ReplicateLoop 落后→切片发送\n  (lagging_for_snapshot)\n• InstallSnapshot 接收重组\n  recv_snap_buf_ + epoch去重\n  + 单块≤chunk/整blob CRC\n• SaveSnapshotBlob 锁外落盘\n  (两阶段 / fsync)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• kSnapshotChunkSize=512KiB 切片\n• ReplicateLoop 落后→切片发送\n  (lagging_for_snapshot)\n• InstallSnapshot 接收重组\n  recv_snap_buf_ + epoch去重\n  + 单块≤chunk/整blob CRC\n• SaveSnapshotBlob 锁外落盘\n  (两阶段 / fsync)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
