    {
      "id": "sls_title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1406.9801949854634,
      "y": 1441.3221727225553,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 22,
      "text": "SegmentLogStore（段日志存储 · file_backed 持久化子系统）",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SegmentLogStore（段日志存储 · file_backed 持久化子系统）",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 16,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "seed": 893756,
      "version": 337,
      "versionNonce": 1230420966,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792139831827,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "bhAvV",
      "roundness": null,
      "created": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sls_body1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1406.9801949854634,
      "y": 1473.3221727225553,
      "width": 275.05078125,
      "height": 165,
      "text": "【调用入口 / 双写镜像】\n• 构造期：先 Open() 再 ReadPersist()\n• 每条记录 [u32 len][u32 crc][body]\n• append-only 追加写 raft.log.seg\n• entries与 logs_ 双写：Append / TruncateSuffix\n  / TruncatePrefix（切割点对齐），entries是从磁盘\n  映射出来不带哨兵index=0的日志数组，logs是原来\n  带哨兵的日志数组\n• Replay(snap_term,snp_idx) → 哨兵+entries_\n• ResetFromLogs() 重启追平（相同则跳过）\n• 内存模式 seg_log_=nullptr → 空操作",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "【调用入口 / 双写镜像】\n• 构造期：先 Open() 再 ReadPersist()\n• 每条记录 [u32 len][u32 crc][body]\n• append-only 追加写 raft.log.seg\n• entries与 logs_ 双写：Append / TruncateSuffix\n  / TruncatePrefix（切割点对齐），entries是从磁盘\n  映射出来不带哨兵index=0的日志数组，logs是原来\n  带哨兵的日志数组\n• Replay(snap_term,snp_idx) → 哨兵+entries_\n• ResetFromLogs() 重启追平（相同则跳过）\n• 内存模式 seg_log_=nullptr → 空操作",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "seed": 679442,
      "version": 500,
      "versionNonce": 695197050,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792139831827,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "bhAw",
      "roundness": null,
      "created": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sls_body2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1696.9801949854634,
      "y": 1473.3221727225553,
      "width": 252.732421875,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "【崩溃恢复 / Group Commit】\n• 尾部半截 → 安全丢弃 + ftruncate\n• 非法 len(>256MB) → 安全丢弃\n• 中段 CRC 损坏 → abort（fail-stop）\n• 索引不连续 → abort（fail-stop）\n• Group Commit：Sync(false) 去抖合并\n• 提交屏障：每次commit_index更新后，\n  Sync(true) 强制落盘，不再随PersisterLocked\n  一起整个重新写logs，PersisterLocked 内Sync\n  (false)变为了批量提交\n• state blob 不再带日志(n=0)\n• fsync 在 mu_ 内执行（沿用旧模式）",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "【崩溃恢复 / Group Commit】\n• 尾部半截 → 安全丢弃 + ftruncate\n• 非法 len(>256MB) → 安全丢弃\n• 中段 CRC 损坏 → abort（fail-stop）\n• 索引不连续 → abort（fail-stop）\n• Group Commit：Sync(false) 去抖合并\n• 提交屏障：每次commit_index更新后，\n  Sync(true) 强制落盘，不再随PersisterLocked\n  一起整个重新写logs，PersisterLocked 内Sync\n  (false)变为了批量提交\n• state blob 不再带日志(n=0)\n• fsync 在 mu_ 内执行（沿用旧模式）",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
