    {
      "id": "nw_499612",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25.587458263506278,
      "y": 2114.3099271781734,
      "width": 276,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "Network（中央交换机）\n• timers_：按到期时间排序的 multimap\n• TimerLoop：唯一泵线程，取最早事件\n• Schedule / Finish：入队 / 收尾",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Network（中央交换机）\n• timers_：按到期时间排序的 multimap\n• TimerLoop：唯一泵线程，取最早事件\n• Schedule / Finish：入队 / 收尾",
