      "type": "text",
      "x": 345.5874582635063,
      "y": 2114.3099271781734,
      "width": 276,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "ReplySlot（共享内存 rendezvous）\n• 请求携带 shared_ptr<ReplySlot>\n• 含 cv / done / reply\n• 回包靠它 notify 唤醒（非回程路由）",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ReplySlot（共享内存 rendezvous）\n• 请求携带 shared_ptr<ReplySlot>\n• 含 cv / done / reply\n• 回包靠它 notify 唤醒（非回程路由）",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
