    {
      "id": "nw_558338",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 345.5874582635063,
      "y": 2284.3099271781734,
      "width": 276,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "Server + Service::Handler（接收端）\n• Dispatch(字节串 in → 字节串 out)\n• 内部调你注册的 RPC 函数\n• 执行时抢 Raft 锁",
