    {
      "id": "nw_778662",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25.587458263506278,
      "y": 2434.3099271781734,
      "width": 596,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "三个混沌旋钮（测试用，模拟破网络）\n• reliable=false：请求 10% 丢 + 回包 10% 丢（均转 ok=false，让客户端重试而非死等）\n• longreordering：回包 2/3 概率延迟 200~2200ms（仅乱序回包，制造乱序）\n• enabled / DeleteServer：控制收发开关（模拟断网 / 崩溃）",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "三个混沌旋钮（测试用，模拟破网络）\n• reliable=false：请求 10% 丢 + 回包 10% 丢（均转 ok=false，让客户端重试而非死等）\n• longreordering：回包 2/3 概率延迟 200~2200ms（仅乱序回包，制造乱序）\n• enabled / DeleteServer：控制收发开关（模拟断网 / 崩溃）",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
